            "review_title": "Review at Noa Bistro Pizza",
            "review_text": "Sharon J\n1 contribution\n0\nDirty place and bad foods\nJan 2026 • Friends\nDon't go to that restaurant. It's awfully dirty. Look in the toilets and kitchen before you order; you'll be shocked at how messy it is. You'll probably catch some bacteria, like what happened to me. The menu says the meat is imported, but it's not true; it's Vietnamese beef. The pizza is bad and undercooked. I definitely don't recommend this pizza place.\n\nDon't go to this restaurant. It's filthy. Check the restrooms and the kitchen before you order; you'll be shocked at how dirty it is. You'll probably pick up some bacteria, like I did. The menu says the meat is imported, but that's not true; it's Vietnamese beef. The pizza is bad and undercooked. I definitely don't recommend this pizzeria.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten January 31, 2026",
